#: _protected/app/system/modules/error/controllers/HttpController.php:70
msgid "A request was made of a resource using a request method not supported by that resource;[2] for example, using GET on a form which requires data to be presented via POST, or using PUT on a read-only resource."
msgstr "ມີການສົ່ງຄຳຂໍໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ; ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໃຊ້ GET ໃນແບບຟອມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ POST, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ PUT ໃນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຫ້ອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ."

#: _protected/app/system/modules/error/controllers/HttpController.php:75
