#: _protected/app/system/modules/error/controllers/HttpController.php:78
msgid "The server encountered an error. This is most often caused by a scripting problem, a failed database access attempt, or other similar reasons.<br />Please come back later!"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍມັກຈະເກີດຈາກບັນຫາສະຄຣິບ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຫຼື ເຫດຜົນອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ.<br />ກະລຸນາກັບມາໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ!"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/error/controllers/HttpController.php:83
