msgstr "😡 ບໍ່ພໍໃຈບໍ່? 🔨"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:9
msgid "👺 Angry?! 😡"
msgstr "👺 ຮ້າຍແລ້ວຫວາ?! 😡"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:16
msgid "Not totally satisfied with the software?"
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ພໍໃຈກັບຊອບແວທັງໝົດເທື່ອແມ່ນບໍ່?"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:16
msgid "Nowadays, competitors are so strong, and you alone, cannot do much?"
msgstr "ທຸກມື້ນີ້, ຄູ່ແຂ່ງແມ່ນແຂງແຮງຫຼາຍ, ແລະທ່ານພຽງລຳພັງ ອາດຈະເຮັດຫຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍ?"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:20
msgid "You think you will never succeed with your current website?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຄິດວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີວັນປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດກັບເວັບໄຊປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນບໍ່?"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:24
msgid "You want something (much much) better...?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສິ່ງທີ່ດີກວ່າ (ຫຼາຍໆ) ບໍ່...?"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:28
msgid "Well... you are not alone! I totally understand you!"
msgstr "ເອົາລະ... ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ຄົນດຽວ! ຂ້ອຍເຂົ້າໃຈທ່ານດີ!"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:30
msgid "...if you want to help me making the software (and so, your website) the best on the market."
msgstr "...ຖ້າທ່ານຢາກຊ່ວຍຂ້ອຍເຮັດໃຫ້ຊອບແວ (ແລະເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ) ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນທ້ອງຕະຫຼາດ."

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:31
msgid "And impress the big sharks out there! 🦈"
msgstr "ແລະເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກຍັກໃຫຍ່ໃນວົງການປະທັບໃຈ! 🦈"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:32
msgid "Would you be willing to give a contribution? And being part of this amazing project?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຢາກຈະປະກອບສ່ວນບໍ່? ແລະເຂົ້າມາເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຄງການທີ່ໜ້າຕື່ນເຕັ້ນນີ້?"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:35
msgid "Once you made a donation, I will ship faster and better to you new features and changes to the software 🚀"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານບໍລິຈາກແລ້ວ, ຂ້ອຍຈະພັດທະນາ ແລະ ສົ່ງມອບຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໆ ລວມທັງການປັບປຸງຊອບແວໃຫ້ທ່ານໄວຂຶ້ນ 🚀"

#: _protected/app/system/modules/ph7cms-helper/views/base/tpl/main/upsetbox.tpl:40
msgid "YES!! Make It Much Better!!!"
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ!! ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນດີຂຶ້ນກວ່າເກົ່າຫຼາຍໆ!!!"

